ser (using the Linux command-line display program) Ask the user whether or not it should be rotated; if so, do it. (using the Linux command-line convert program) Ask the user for a caption, and collect it. Generate a properly oriented half-size version of the photo (using the Linux command-line convert program) When done, the program should leave the following in the directory in which it was invoked. (That is, if you were in foo/ when you invoked album, then all these things go into foo/) a file index.html containing, for each photo: a properly oriented thumbnail a caption a link from the thumbnail to a properly oriented medium-size version of the photo the thumbnails and medium-size versions.","topics":[],"score":190437,"global_rank":353496},{"name":"quinkennedy/flatmap","owner":"quinkennedy","html_url":"https://github.com/quinkennedy/flatmap","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Clojure","description":"an exploration of warping polylines into straight lines","topics":[],"score":190437,"global_rank":353501},{"name":"patrick-east/devstack-plugin-cinder-image-cache","owner":"patrick-east","html_url":"https://github.com/patrick-east/devstack-plugin-cinder-image-cache","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Shell","description":"DevStack plugin for configuring the Cinder Glance Image Cache","topics":[],"score":190437,"global_rank":353503},{"name":"sbeckeriv/rust-algorithms-helpers","owner":"sbeckeriv","html_url":"https://github.com/sbeckeriv/rust-algorithms-helpers","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Rust","description":"crap im copying all around. make cargo copy it","topics":[],"score":190437,"global_rank":353504},{"name":"TheRinger/em-control-box","owner":"TheRinger","html_url":"https://github.com/TheRinger/em-control-box","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"C","description":"Electronic monitoring control box for commercial fisheries.","topics":[],"score":190437,"global_rank":353505},{"nam